a given commit is reproducible — see the note at the top of `docker/Dockerfile`.
The tag is recorded for readability only; the digest is what Docker resolves.

`public.ecr.aws/docker/library/*` is ECR Public's mirror of the Docker Hub official
images. The two digests below are byte-identical to the `ros:humble-ros-base` and
